 ### Data Structures
-The method processes cells based on a diamond cubic lattice [S1, S2, unofficial]. Each cell is defined by 5 vertices [S1, S2, unofficial]. The vertices are indexed to facilitate a specific ordering where every other point is inverted, allowing modulo arithmetic for indexing [S2, unofficial].
